 {'idx': 6, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Joseph Hubert Cogels (14 January 1894 – 26 July 1978) was a Belgian sport shooter who competed in the 1920 Summer Olympics. In 1920 he won the silver medal as member of the Belgian team in the team clay pigeons competition.', 'title': 'Joseph Cogels'}
 {'idx': 7, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'Sébastien Huyghe (born October 25, 1969 in Béthune, Pas-de-Calais) is a member of the National Assembly of France. He represents the Nord department, and is a member of the Republicans.', 'title': 'Sébastien Huyghe'}
